<article id="about-me" class="about-summary">
    <h1>About Yintong</h1>

    <section aria-labelledby="profile-title" class="mt-4">
        <h2 id="profile-title">Software Developer in Milan</h2>
        <p>
            I am Yintong, a software developer based in Milan, Italy, with professional experience designing and developing
            web applications, backend services and Windows applications. I work mainly with C#, .NET, ASP.NET MVC, HTML, CSS,
            JavaScript, jQuery and Bootstrap, with a strong focus on maintainable code and reliable software.
        </p>
        <p>
            My technical background also includes relational database design and management with SQL Server, PostgreSQL and
            Oracle PL/SQL. I develop stored procedures, functions and packages, and collaborate with cross-functional teams
            through code reviews, testing and quality assurance activities.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="experience-title" class="mt-4">
        <h2 id="experience-title">Professional Experience</h2>
        <p>
            Since May 2023, I have worked as a Software Developer at Sirti S.P.A. in Milan, developing ASP.NET MVC applications
            with C#, front-end technologies and Oracle PL/SQL. Previously, I spent more than five years at ML SISTEMI S.R.L.,
            where I developed C# and .NET Framework services, console applications and ASP.NET MVC backends using SQL Server
            and PostgreSQL.
        </p>
        <p>
            My earlier experience includes Windows Forms development, Windows services, Windows Server administration, network
            analysis with Wireshark, VoIP systems and virtual machines with VMware Workstation. I also volunteer as IT Manager
            for the Italian Chinese Professional Network, supporting a professional community that connects Italy and China.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="skills-title" class="mt-4">
        <h2 id="skills-title">Skills and Technologies</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Backend:</strong> C#, .NET, .NET Framework, ASP.NET and MVC.</li>
            <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML, CSS, JavaScript, jQuery and Bootstrap.</li>
            <li><strong>Databases:</strong> SQL Server, PostgreSQL, Oracle SQL and PL/SQL.</li>
            <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Windows Server, networking, routing, VoIP and VMware.</li>
            <li><strong>Security:</strong> vulnerability analysis, system hardening, ethical hacking and cryptography.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="education-title" class="mt-4">
        <h2 id="education-title">Education and Certifications</h2>
        <p>
            I studied Cisco networking fundamentals through the CCNA programme and developed cybersecurity skills through
            CompTIA Security+ and EC-Council training. My studies covered network access, IP connectivity, IP services,
            security fundamentals, automation, vulnerability analysis, system hardening and cryptography.
        </p>
    </section>
